  <item>
    <title>低能量面壁人：差旅自救好物指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6909f3a1aaf2588eb7ea1d13</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6909f3a1aaf2588eb7ea1d13</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Nov 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【内容简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>想从从容容游刃有余，面壁躺平自闭放空，却逃不开匆匆忙忙连滚带爬，陪家人旅行、加班出差的日常？对低能量星人来说，看似普通的行程，早已耗尽全身力气——又懒又怕折腾、受不得半点委屈，跋山涉水的差旅该怎么“自救”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>年尾换季+双十一尾声，正是囤货好时机！既要精简行李不添负，又要快速拉满幸福感，低能量差旅的“事半功倍”小心得的是什么？本期节目专为高频出行党盘点宝藏好物，帮你在辗转旅途里轻松回血～</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqO_Fn99IBXukcqDerImOMAqXxPn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【时码】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 适合低能量人的旅行定制师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 本以为是一个包间的婚宴酒席，最后膨胀到23桌的i人修罗场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 洋葱穿衣法在新疆也不行？推荐烘鞋机和干衣机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 战狼邪修：超轻又显瘦的女士作战山地靴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> 新疆之旅必备：青汁粉和液体沙拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a> 泡面竟是马拉松比赛日的超棒早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 古法广式煲汤煮茶养生法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1824">30:24</a> 真丝枕套，提升幸福感的性价比之王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2016">33:36</a> 自备精油和香氛花洒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 便携款的华强北戴森吹风机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> 高级软卧的翻车之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 卡片式手消、筋膜球、足贴、足底暖宝宝和肌肉按摩膏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a> 不是相机买不起，是租相机更有性价比</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小鹿&amp;黑桃</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6806c2849e23305625b60a00/lnNwkX4zsW5wUtlmu8T6E8BaDaza.m4a" length="100655041" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:08</itunes:duration>
