  <item>
    <title>小饭桌返场：我们怀念的不是现炒，是有人用心做饭给你吃</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c943c32c82c9dccaac4022</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c943c32c82c9dccaac4022</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 16 Sep 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/565fc7b5b8c8b43b08cf4d71?xsec_token=YBBAZZ2bVhn53wy0Hl-es4s7n5pAixDTmTWXFWZP4JB_Q%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;shareRedId=N0g0MUVIOkI6TEZFSkoxTDpJSz09PjlP&amp;apptime=1758003656&amp;share_id=baad1e6caea24688a4d05351cc9b59b9&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/565fc7b5b8c8b43b08cf4d71?xsec_token=YBBAZZ2bVhn53wy0Hl-es4s7n5pAixDTmTWXFWZP4JB_Q%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;shareRedId=N0g0MUVIOkI6TEZFSkoxTDpJSz09PjlP&amp;apptime=1758003656&amp;share_id=baad1e6caea24688a4d05351cc9b59b9&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>小饭桌</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64c26899000000001403e8df?xsec_token=YB6zQXB7uJSyowLweQpb_nDouKaLr6S7dlB-Z1IT94W0M%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;shareRedId=N0g0MUVIOkI6TEZFSkoxTDpJSz09PjlP&amp;apptime=1758003675&amp;share_id=f7b9d3d26657409eac99f78180c23662&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64c26899000000001403e8df?xsec_token=YB6zQXB7uJSyowLweQpb_nDouKaLr6S7dlB-Z1IT94W0M%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;shareRedId=N0g0MUVIOkI6TEZFSkoxTDpJSz09PjlP&amp;apptime=1758003675&amp;share_id=f7b9d3d26657409eac99f78180c23662&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>珊珊的小红书</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/630c216f000000001200144e?xsec_token=YBfhjNaESKt1S0Wg3OjJyTkoc4SjoHsybGtL3QCv_5xmg%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;shareRedId=N0g0MUVIOkI6TEZFSkoxTDpJSz09PjlP&amp;apptime=1758003723&amp;share_id=f1818c71f76a42edabc1eb92a3d37e80&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/630c216f000000001200144e?xsec_token=YBfhjNaESKt1S0Wg3OjJyTkoc4SjoHsybGtL3QCv_5xmg%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;shareRedId=N0g0MUVIOkI6TEZFSkoxTDpJSz09PjlP&amp;apptime=1758003723&amp;share_id=f1818c71f76a42edabc1eb92a3d37e80&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>不務正业Havefun</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【内容简介】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683eef9c31215eb5061f66ae" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683eef9c31215eb5061f66ae"><span>《自从做了小饭桌，他们每天都在想放弃》</span></a><span>播出后，许多听友都为珊珊和老王对美食品质的坚持而感动。但没过多久，他们就迫于经营压力决定关店，忍痛停掉利润更可观的牛腩煲堂食，把所有心思都放回新鲜现炒的小饭桌。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhmSJtsZhbf0AsmMd_iSx9acGlFE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在菜品趋同、餐饮变味的今天，我们不得不面对价格与品质两难的选择，就像不得不面对餐饮行业里越来越普遍的“工序前置”。这次，借着对预制菜的热议，我们再次邀请珊珊和老王。作为对食材挑剔到近乎苛刻、又要在效率与利润间寻找出路的餐饮人，一起来聊聊：预制菜真的会改写餐饮的味道吗？当我们执着于“现炒”二字，执着的是什么？只有一身笨功夫的美食匠人，又该如何在当今餐饮业寻求属于自己的一片天地？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqO_Fn99IBXukcqDerImOMAqXxPn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> 节目播出后，珊珊和老王关掉了牛腩煲的堂食，专做新鲜现炒的小饭桌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a> 小饭桌主理人如何看待预制菜风波中的“标准和规定”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 品质与价格难两全，珊珊和老王细说为何舍弃利润更高的牛腩煲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a> 成本意识和良心定价的博弈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2319">38:39</a> 小饭桌的经营困境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2398">39:58</a> 不同的菜也得调出不同的糖醋口，小饭桌的人性化和真诚用心是制胜法宝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2869">47:49</a> 美食荒漠是如何形成的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3249">54:09</a> 孤独的美食家正在等待懂他的食客，匠心手艺人期待开辟一条自己的赛道</span></p>]]></description>
