  <item>
    <title>舞蹈羞耻:你有肢体表现恐惧症吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68933e6e638b01587944bf79</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68933e6e638b01587944bf79</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Aug 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：Diego</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/665eb22363c334a2fb3cbd47" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/665eb22363c334a2fb3cbd47"><span>《自由探戈》播客</span></a><span>主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿根廷球迷俱乐部前主席/中国阿根廷探戈行业OG</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿根廷体育及文化活动组织者/阿根廷文化推广人</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c678c6b000000001102f51f?xsec_token=YBpY47QLPSwevHRuheAoCZUohVI46en0WEwMP0FrK78_A%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=630c216f000000001200144e&amp;apptime=1754480063&amp;share_id=e083fba9f0914e36ad2debf8d0eed236&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c678c6b000000001102f51f?xsec_token=YBpY47QLPSwevHRuheAoCZUohVI46en0WEwMP0FrK78_A%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=630c216f000000001200144e&amp;apptime=1754480063&amp;share_id=e083fba9f0914e36ad2debf8d0eed236&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>自由探戈播客</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>认识老马，是从自由探戈播客的舞动疗愈开始。听他聊起探戈里的肢体语言，突然就被点醒了——芭蕾的优雅严苛与探戈的随性张力，明明是两种截然不同的美，可对我们这些零基础的舞蹈爱好者来说，那份藏在动作里的羞耻感，却总是如出一辙。</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是特意邀了老马来串台，好好聊聊“舞蹈羞耻”这件事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>舞蹈羞耻：为“标准”紧绷的神经，为“自律”苛责的自我，为“完美”纠结的细节，甚至为“舞伴”揣度的目光……在传统语境浸润的成长里，我们似乎总在被推着追求“结果”：教育里重答案轻过程，生活中把“优秀”“成功”挂在嘴边，却偏偏忘了，身体本就该是最诚实的表达者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是舞蹈，从来都不是用来被评判的。它是人类用肢体诉说精神的语言，是情绪奔涌时的出口，是灵魂向外生长的触角，更是身体与心灵握手言和的温柔场域。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这期分享能像一阵风，吹散你心里的包袱。试着和自己的身体说说话吧，在抬手、转身、摇摆的瞬间，感受那份久违的联结。或许你会发现，那个在舞动中舒展的自己，本就值得被好好爱着。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/630c216f000000001200144e?xsec_token=YBKqG4m3w0v1g7JikfBoGQV76lyn4pE8VmkUEsI71p61M%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=630c216f000000001200144e&amp;apptime=1754480125&amp;share_id=b933599239914a1395ff85488a4ae676&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/630c216f000000001200144e?xsec_token=YBKqG4m3w0v1g7JikfBoGQV76lyn4pE8VmkUEsI71p61M%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=630c216f000000001200144e&amp;apptime=1754480125&amp;share_id=b933599239914a1395ff85488a4ae676&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>不務正业Havefun</span></a></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqO_Fn99IBXukcqDerImOMAqXxPn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="331">00:05:31</a>:舞蹈的起源：从巫术到表达情感，揭秘人类的肢体语言交流方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">00:11:05</a>:个人理解的好看：Tango舞蹈的审美标准与自我要求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="996">00:16:36</a>:舞者的心态与夸奖：真正的鼓励还是虚伪的夸赞？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">00:22:09</a>:接受自己的不完美：超越焦虑的自我成长之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">00:27:44</a>:超越初心，寻找真正的自己——艺术行业中的自我疏导之道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">00:33:16</a>:舞蹈之路：努力与进步的关联，艺术感知力的重要性。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2327">00:38:47</a>:舞蹈中的肢体焦虑：突破羞耻心，向前迈出坚实的一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2661">00:44:21</a>:从思维到肢体：探索内心平静与自我认知的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3325">00:55:25</a>:追求卓越还是接受自我？探寻舞蹈在人生中的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">01:01:00</a>:爱自己，与自己和解：探索自我认知的深度与广度</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6806c2849e23305625b60a00/lg4OWRnCkyW0hIRtXg-ficegb4QU.m4a" length="128685782" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:06:39</itunes:duration>
